
  db_audit_gm -- Prometheus metrics store node

  Configuration:  /etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml  (scrape targets, retention)
  Prometheus:     http://localhost:9090/prometheus/  (curl, promtool query ...)
                  from your browser: the bastion's web front, /prometheus/
  Apply changes:  sudo gm-reload-prometheus   check, then reload the configuration
  Check:          sudo gm-validate            public validator

  DO NOT TAMPER with SSH, sudo, the gm-* wrappers or the validator.

